# SCPN MIF Plasma Jet Core — citation metadata
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you reference this repository, cite it as below. No release, version,
  or DOI exists yet; cite the repository state you inspected.
type: software
title: SCPN MIF Plasma Jet Core
abstract: >-
  Governed device-family repository for the plasma-jet magneto-inertial
  fusion configuration within the SCPN Reactor Systems Research Group.
  Evidence maturity computational_prototype: a validated device
  configuration model, diagnostic and clock semantics aligned with the
  SCPN Phase Orchestrator observability catalogue, and level-0 device
  physics (the mass, kinetic energy, ram pressure and spherical coverage
  fraction of a declared jet array, and ideal spherical density and
  adiabatic compression recorded as upper bounds). Parameter sets are
  synthetic or anchored on a filed public source; no real machine is
  described, and the claim inventory is empty.
